<title>USA: New Milford Bank &amp; Trust Co Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>New Milford Bank &amp; Trust Co Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW MILFORD, Conn. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.29		    $0.23</p>
<p> Net			    792			652</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,684		    2,590</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.04		    $0.83</p>
<p> Net			  2,792		    2,159</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,684		    2,590</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Provision for loan losses at December 31, 1996, was $390,000 vs $160,000 at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Total deposits at December 31, 1996, $266.2 million versus $247.1 million at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
